  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>&bull; Brand introduction:</strong> Little Lash Lab is set on creating products to empower and make people feel confident and beautiful. Our brand is focused on providing premium, affordable yet highly effective lash products. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>&bull; Product Description: </strong>Little Lash Lab Lash Serum is the best lash serum formulation that works to give you longer, thicker lashes and fuller eyebrows. Our botanical-based formula is gentle on the skin and contains no harsh chemicals, and helps to promote healthier, stronger lashes with consistent use.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong> We pride ourselves on being an Australian, Female Owned Business, that produces high-quality lash products that feel luxurious without the expensive price tag. Our serum has been formulated without prostaglandins (an ingredient that is used in many serums that causes irritation) and with botanical extracts, attracting customers with an interest in natural and gentle products.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>&bull; Payment terms:&nbsp;</strong>Bank Transfer, Debit Card or PayPal</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>",
